#: title/pc5_ui.c:7638
msgid ""
"A .NET program: PC5 sets up what it needs the first time a .NET game "
"starts."
msgstr ".NET程序：首次启动.NET游戏时，PC5会准备它所需的内容。"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7642
msgid ""
"The game is copied once and checked, to the console or, with a USB drive "
